  "title": "Gorgonzola and Prosciutto Tortellini Salad",
  "description": "Prosciutto, Gorgonzola, bell peppers, and tortellini are tossed with an herby vinaigrette for this picnic- and potluck-ready, Italian-inspired pasta salad.",
  "authors": [
